  "title": "Integrated information theory is bridge-debted",
  "statements": [
    {
      "id": "dfd3ba62-f375-4481-b2aa-0a5b6f60da94",
      "text": "IIT derives physical postulates from phenomenal axioms and so presupposes a phenomenal-physical distinction it never witnesses on its own terms. Its foundational question is therefore not yet admissible, which is a different claim from calling it false.",
